    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement by a Spellcaster)</em></p><p>This withered hand or talon hangs from a leather cord that can be worn as a necklace or a bracelet. While wearing the trophy, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Dispelling Touch.</strong> When you hit a creature with a melee spell attack, you can activate the trophy to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic} as part of that attack, targeting the creature you hit. Once used, this property can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p><p><strong>Helping Hand.</strong> When you cast a spell using a spell slot, you can cast it without Somatic components.</p><p><strong>Mage Hand.</strong> You can cast the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMageHand00]{Mage Hand} cantrip from the trophy.</p>",
